01:03:32.000 --> 01:03:35.210
but sometimes how do you actually account

01:03:35.210 --> 01:03:36.680
for how much you have actually done?

01:03:36.680 --> 01:03:40.180
Or how do you account how
productive you have been

01:03:40.180 --> 01:03:41.080
as an entrepreneur?

01:03:41.080 --> 01:03:42.980
For example, I could write one article

01:03:42.980 --> 01:03:44.660
and I could be very productive.

01:03:44.660 --> 01:03:47.400
I could write three articles
but I'm not productive.

01:03:47.400 --> 01:03:50.520
So, how do you actually account
of how much work I have done

01:03:50.520 --> 01:03:51.563
as an entrepreneur?

01:03:52.510 --> 01:03:54.450
- It sounds like you're
doing what we all do

01:03:54.450 --> 01:03:55.760
which is it sounds like you're being

01:03:55.760 --> 01:03:57.260
your own judge and jury.

01:03:57.260 --> 01:03:58.430
- [Reagan] Right.

01:03:58.430 --> 01:04:00.570
- So, I think you just
need to love yourself more.

01:04:00.570 --> 01:04:01.970
- Right.
(audience laughing)

01:04:01.970 --> 01:04:02.803
- I'm being serious.

01:04:02.803 --> 01:04:04.330
It's a very interesting insight.

01:04:04.330 --> 01:04:06.440
When you were asking the question,

01:04:06.440 --> 01:04:09.353
I think every day, I'm phenomenal.

01:04:11.440 --> 01:04:13.130
I'm being dead serious.

01:04:13.130 --> 01:04:15.800
Because I'm trying as hard as I can,

01:04:15.800 --> 01:04:19.250
I have very good intent,
I'm really trying,

01:04:19.250 --> 01:04:21.630
and if today was a less productive day

01:04:21.630 --> 01:04:24.330
'cause I was tired or a
meeting didn't go well

01:04:24.330 --> 01:04:25.740
or who knows why,

01:04:25.740 --> 01:04:29.460
I'm just not capable of
beating myself up today.

01:04:29.460 --> 01:04:31.513
I look at it over the course of time.

01:04:32.440 --> 01:04:36.800
I mean, you know, you get to
be the judge and the jury.

01:04:36.800 --> 01:04:37.860
- Right, right.

01:04:37.860 --> 01:04:40.433
One more question, it's
actually about millennials.

01:04:41.350 --> 01:04:43.880
A lot of times, people see
that, oh, this guy's too young

01:04:43.880 --> 01:04:46.980
or for me, as a Singaporean,
it's like, you haven't go army,

01:04:46.980 --> 01:04:48.143
why should I listen to you?

01:04:48.143 --> 01:04:50.550
And you also say about
being authentic, right?

01:04:50.550 --> 01:04:52.213
But I'm being authentic
and sometimes people

01:04:52.213 --> 01:04:57.160
just don't believe of let's
say my experience or portfolio.

01:04:57.160 --> 01:05:00.240
- That was my whole life from 20 to 40.

01:05:00.240 --> 01:05:02.280
- Right.
(audience chuckling)

01:05:02.280 --> 01:05:03.360
Right.

01:05:03.360 --> 01:05:06.900
Basically, just be authentic
and just share with the world

01:05:06.900 --> 01:05:08.430
what you just really want to share.

01:05:08.430 --> 01:05:09.263
- What's the alternative?

01:05:09.263 --> 01:05:10.821
Make shit up?
(audience laughing)

01:05:10.821 --> 01:05:12.160
- [Reagan] (chuckles) Right.

01:05:12.160 --> 01:05:13.585
- You know what I mean?
- Yes.

01:05:13.585 --> 01:05:16.660
- Look.
(audience applauding)

01:05:16.660 --> 01:05:19.050
Everything that you now know me for

01:05:19.050 --> 01:05:21.830
is nothing I was saying and doing

01:05:21.830 --> 01:05:24.370
was accepted when I was doing it.

01:05:24.370 --> 01:05:27.623
Guys, I launched an
e-commerce business in 1996.

01:05:28.500 --> 01:05:31.130
People thought the internet was a fad.

01:05:31.130 --> 01:05:32.980
Email, Google AdWords.

01:05:32.980 --> 01:05:35.910
I started one of the
first YouTube shows ever.

01:05:35.910 --> 01:05:37.590
I invested in Facebook and Twitter

01:05:37.590 --> 01:05:39.260
before anybody ever heard of it.

01:05:39.260 --> 01:05:41.910
Tumblr, Uber, everything.

01:05:41.910 --> 01:05:44.080
I started having a man
follow me with a camera

01:05:44.080 --> 01:05:45.470
three years ago.

01:05:45.470 --> 01:05:46.540
People thought that,

01:05:46.540 --> 01:05:49.920
everything I do, you're gonna be the,

01:05:49.920 --> 01:05:52.960
you can't be upset and
try to convince people

01:05:52.960 --> 01:05:54.650
who are gonna judge you on age.

01:05:54.650 --> 01:05:56.960
You just need to move
on to the next person

01:05:56.960 --> 01:05:59.320
