not gonna judge you on age.

01:05:59.320 --> 01:06:02.450
And by the way, youngsters, take it from,

01:06:02.450 --> 01:06:03.680
who's over 40 here?

01:06:03.680 --> 01:06:05.110
Raise your hands.

01:06:05.110 --> 01:06:06.650
Raise it high.

01:06:06.650 --> 01:06:10.350
Us with our hands up, we lived in a world

01:06:10.350 --> 01:06:13.830
