01:06:15.210 --> 01:06:17.380
Because technology became big,

01:06:17.380 --> 01:06:21.740
you guys are way more
respected than we were at 25.

01:06:21.740 --> 01:06:24.340
You're over-respected.
(audience chuckling)

01:06:24.340 --> 01:06:25.173
I mean it.

01:06:25.173 --> 01:06:27.880
People think, oh, you're a
kid, you understand technology.

01:06:27.880 --> 01:06:28.823
No, you don't.

01:06:29.730 --> 01:06:34.370
So, the reality is, you've
heard a lot of this today.

01:06:34.370 --> 01:06:37.040
Don't be in the convincing business.

01:06:37.040 --> 01:06:39.270
Go to who's already convinced.

01:06:39.270 --> 01:06:40.465
- All right.
- You know what I mean?

01:06:40.465 --> 01:06:41.634
- Thank you so much.
- You got it.

01:06:41.634 --> 01:06:42.467
- [Man In Black Shirt] One question, Gary.

01:06:42.467 --> 01:06:44.143
- Hi, Gary, last question?
- Yes.

01:06:45.300 --> 01:06:46.430
- Last question?
- Yep.

01:06:46.430 --> 01:06:49.270
- Hi, I'm Jillian and
I've been following you

01:06:49.270 --> 01:06:51.000
