(Jillian laughs)

01:09:18.730 --> 01:09:20.837
You know, so that's what I mean.

01:09:20.837 --> 01:09:22.570
- [Jillian] Okay, thank you for coming

01:09:22.570 --> 01:09:23.803
to my home country, Singapore.

01:09:23.803 --> 01:09:26.570
