- What contextual creative

01:09:26.570 --> 01:09:27.403
would you do for this?

01:09:27.403 --> 01:09:30.870
What kinda slangs do you have
for our Singaporean market?

01:09:30.870 --> 01:09:32.780
- The number one thing that I think about

01:09:32.780 --> 01:09:34.690
for this market and this region

01:09:34.690 --> 01:09:37.960
is the dynamic of parents'
pressure on children.

01:09:37.960 --> 01:09:38.860
- [Jillian] Mm.

01:09:38.860 --> 01:09:39.960
(audience applauding)
(audience cheering)

01:09:39.960 --> 01:09:41.800
- It is my number one.

01:09:41.800 --> 01:09:42.973
It is my number one.

01:09:44.540 --> 01:09:46.210
It is a problem in America

01:09:46.210 --> 01:09:49.930
but it is absolutely more
prevalent in Asian countries

01:09:49.930 --> 01:09:52.700
where parents think kids' success

01:09:52.700 --> 01:09:54.450
is an indicator on them

01:09:54.450 --> 01:09:56.660
and they treat their
children like products,

01:09:56.660 --> 01:09:57.560
not like children.

01:09:58.517 --> 01:10:00.170
(audience cheering)
(audience applauding)

01:10:00.170 --> 01:10:01.470
- Thank you for that.

01:10:01.470 --> 01:10:02.420
I agree with you.

01:10:02.420 --> 01:10:05.140
I actually quit my corporate job

01:10:05.140 --> 01:10:08.620
