01:10:08.620 --> 01:10:12.490
So, (chuckling) defy my
parents' notion of the ambition

01:10:12.490 --> 01:10:14.620
and just went for what I love.

01:10:14.620 --> 01:10:15.690
- I love it.
- Thank you.

01:10:15.690 --> 01:10:16.523
- Singapore, thank you.
(audience applauding)

01:10:16.523 --> 01:10:18.330
I'm sorry.
- All right.

